{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52449","headline":"回波乐 九十二 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有钱不造福，甚是老愚痴。\n自身不吃着，保（张改作「报」）投受（戴校「持授」）妻儿。\n打脊眼不痛，十指不同皮。\n饱吃身自（一作「自身」）稳，饿肚身自饥。\n积十年调宁（项改「贮积千年调」），知身得几时（张改二句作「莫积千年调，宁知得几时。\n」）。\n一朝身磨灭，万事不能{宀/兑}（项校「窥」，张改作「究」）。\n妻嫁後人妇，子变他家儿。\n奴婢换曹主，马即别人骑。\n闻强急修福，莫於（项校「逾」）百年期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}